109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (The rapid growth of the aquaculture industry requires continuous and precise monitoring of water parameters to ensure aquatic health and maximize yield. Traditional manual sampling methods are time-consuming, labor-intensive, and fail to provide real-time insights. As environmental and operational demands increase, there is a critical need for autonomous systems capable of continuous data acquisition and remote monitoring. )
/E (The rapid growth of the aquaculture industry requires continuous and precise monitoring of water parameters to ensure aquatic health and maximize yield. Traditional manual sampling methods are time-consuming, labor-intensive, and fail to provide real-time insights. As environmental and operational demands increase, there is a critical need for autonomous systems capable of continuous data acquisition and remote monitoring. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (The primary objective of this internship project was to design and implement a solar-powered Internet of Things \(IoT\) node for real-time water quality monitoring. Instead of relying on conventional grid power, the proposed system operates autonomously using a solar panel and a battery management circuit, ensuring continuous operation even in remote environments.)
/E (The primary objective of this internship project was to design and implement a solar-powered Internet of Things \(IoT\) node for real-time water quality monitoring. Instead of relying on conventional grid power, the proposed system operates autonomously using a solar panel and a battery management circuit, ensuring continuous operation even in remote environments.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (The project also aimed to demonstrate how embedded systems and cloud technologies can be combined to solve real-world agricultural problems. Throughout the internship, the system was developed by following engineering principles such as hardware integration, power management design, microcontroller programming, and cloud platform configuration.)
/E (The project also aimed to demonstrate how embedded systems and cloud technologies can be combined to solve real-world agricultural problems. Throughout the internship, the system was developed by following engineering principles such as hardware integration, power management design, microcontroller programming, and cloud platform configuration.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 63 0 R
/T (Besides technical implementation, the internship provided an opportunity to gain practical experience in modern electronics and IoT methodologies. The completed system consists of an ESP32 microcontroller, an analog turbidity sensor, a temperature probe, a custom power management circuit \(including an MT3608 boost converter\), and a web-based dashboard on Thinger.io. Together, these components create a reliable, low-power architecture capable of real-time environmental monitoring.)
/E (Besides technical implementation, the internship provided an opportunity to gain practical experience in modern electronics and IoT methodologies. The completed system consists of an ESP32 microcontroller, an analog turbidity sensor, a temperature probe, a custom power management circuit \(including an MT3608 boost converter\), and a web-based dashboard on Thinger.io. Together, these components create a reliable, low-power architecture capable of real-time environmental monitoring.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
