172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (To validate the reliability and autonomy of the proposed IoT system, practical field tests were conducted over a one-week period. A critical phase of the testing focused on the efficiency of the solar-powered energy management system. The battery voltage levels were manually tracked and recorded day by day using a digital multimeter to verify the performance of the solar charge controller and the MT3608 boost module.)
/E (To validate the reliability and autonomy of the proposed IoT system, practical field tests were conducted over a one-week period. A critical phase of the testing focused on the efficiency of the solar-powered energy management system. The battery voltage levels were manually tracked and recorded day by day using a digital multimeter to verify the performance of the solar charge controller and the MT3608 boost module.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (At the beginning of the observation period, the initial battery voltage was measured at 3.08V. Over the course of approximately one week, the system was exposed to predominantly cloudy weather conditions, including a brief period of rain. Despite the lack of direct and strong sunlight, the solar panel and power management circuit successfully harvested enough energy to charge the 4-cell battery pack. By the end of the observation period, the multimeter readings indicated a voltage increase to approximately 3.60V.)
/E (At the beginning of the observation period, the initial battery voltage was measured at 3.08V. Over the course of approximately one week, the system was exposed to predominantly cloudy weather conditions, including a brief period of rain. Despite the lack of direct and strong sunlight, the solar panel and power management circuit successfully harvested enough energy to charge the 4-cell battery pack. By the end of the observation period, the multimeter readings indicated a voltage increase to approximately 3.60V.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (This steady rise in voltage under suboptimal, cloudy weather conditions strongly validates the high efficiency of the power hardware architecture. Furthermore, the real-time sensor data and battery status were consistently and successfully transmitted to the Thinger.io dashboard, confirming the stability of the ESP32 Wi-Fi communication and the overall system integration.)
/E (This steady rise in voltage under suboptimal, cloudy weather conditions strongly validates the high efficiency of the power hardware architecture. Furthermore, the real-time sensor data and battery status were consistently and successfully transmitted to the Thinger.io dashboard, confirming the stability of the ESP32 Wi-Fi communication and the overall system integration.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
