414 0 obj
<<
/Title (To validate the reliability and autonomy of the proposed IoT system, practical field tests were conducted over a one-week period. A critical phase of the testing focused on the efficiency of the solar-powered energy management system. The battery voltage levels were manually tracked and recorded day by day using a digital multimeter to verify the performance of the solar charge controller and the MT3608 boost module.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 304 0 R
/Next 464 0 R
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Title (This steady rise in voltage under suboptimal, cloudy weather conditions strongly validates the high efficiency of the power hardware architecture. Furthermore, the real-time sensor data and battery status were consistently and successfully transmitted to the Thinger.io dashboard, confirming the stability of the ESP32 Wi-Fi communication and the overall system integration.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 304 0 R
/Prev 464 0 R
>>
endobj
