/Title (The scope of this internship project covers the end-to-end development of an autonomous IoT hardware node, beginning with component selection and circuit design, and concluding with cloud integration and field evaluation. The project was designed as a modular embedded system that demonstrates how renewable energy and IoT technologies can be combined to create a reliable, scalable monitoring solution for aquaculture.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 547 0 R
/Next 566 0 R
>>
endobj
561 0 obj
<<
/Title (Overall, the project demonstrates the successful integration of embedded hardware, renewable energy management, and modern IoT cloud platforms into a practical, self-sustaining solution capable of addressing real-world challenges faced by contemporary aquaculture facilities.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 547 0 R
/Prev 567 0 R
>>
endobj
